  "body": "## What changed\n\nAll 13 buttons in the bottom center viewport toolbar show a name and an action sentence on hover.\nThe tooltips use the normal egui behavior and respect hover suppression during a drag.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe toolbar painted icons without registering hover help.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `every_bottom_toolbar_button_explains_its_action_on_hover` checks the rendered name and description for every button.\n- The mutation check failed for all 13 buttons when hover registration was removed.\n- `bottom_toolbar_does_not_show_tooltips_outside_or_when_hover_is_suppressed` checks that help stays hidden outside the buttons or during hover suppression.\n- Mutation: removed hover registration. The hover pin failed for all 13 buttons, including Display. Restored the source. All nine toolbar tests passed.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: nine steps passed on the refreshed head. The tests reported 1370 passed and seven ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe images use the real `ShellUi` layout and `View3D` GPU renderer in the existing off-screen capture harness.\nBoth images show the seeded document with the pointer over the bottom toolbar's Frame button.\nThe before image uses the toolbar source from the PR's parent commit.\nThe after image uses PR head `e0d21442fdce5c35b5f56df51afec64017b0649a` and shows all 13 buttons, including Display, with Frame hover help.\nThe capture checks the painted tooltip text before it saves each image.\nNo interactive desktop session ran.\n\nBefore:\n\n![Before: Frame button hovered without help](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/b64d161b1769014892619b7b6ae736e3dbb55514/2783/before.png)\n\nAfter:\n\n![After: Frame button hovered with help](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/1a5f79d774ebaf0e9978f2dafe05b19bc6c4ac79/2783/after-13-buttons.png)\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe release-only pixel snapshots and an interactive desktop session were not exercised.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #2662 touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nIt adds `panel_rect` and `controls_rect` in `viewport_bar.rs` and separate tests in `viewport_bar_tests.rs`.\nThis PR adds tooltip text and hover registration in `draw`.\n\nEffort: low\nChangelog: Added names and action descriptions on hover for all bottom center viewport toolbar buttons.\n\nFixes #2776\n\n",
